{"availability":"available","full":"shobalsabu668-tech/vector-saas-concept","name":"vector-saas-concept","description":"VECTOR — a self-initiated SaaS concept where the marketing site is the product demo. Next.js 15, hand-built SVG charts. Not a real product or client work.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-19T13:23:52Z","updated":"2026-09-19T13:54:00Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://vector-saas-concept.vercel.app","topics":["concept-project","dataviz","nextjs","react","typescript"],"demo":"https://vector-saas-concept.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:52.669Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:52.669Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:52.669Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:02.528Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:52.669Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-initiated concept by Shobal Sabu. VECTOR is a fictional SaaS product. It isn't a real company or client work, and every number on the site is generated.","VECTOR explores a SaaS website where the marketing site is the product demo. Instead of describing features, it lets visitors use a working slice of the product: a live dashboard, a workflow they can run, pricing that does the maths, and a full app demo in the browser.","Designed and built by Shobal Sabu, a creative web developer in Bengaluru. Available for freelance projects: shobalsabu668@gmail.com"],"features":["VECTOR, its customers, prices and every number shown are fictional.","Runs are generated from a seed; the live stream is the same generator moving forward in time.","Nothing in the demo is saved or sent. Changes live in memory for the session.","The docs describe a CLI and SDK that don't exist."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shobalsabu668-tech/vector-saas-concept/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"eb1b4079c338c6cb0c013cf0f50b941c8931984d478d070a